  "training.kicker": "LEARNING GUIDE",
  "training.title": "How AI Learns to Paint: Behind the Scenes",
  "training.intro": "Ever wonder what happens inside a computer when it learns to create art? Instead of thinking like a human, an AI learns through billions of examples and a clever system of rewards. Here is a look behind the curtain at how AI image models are trained.",
  "training.imageLabelingAlt": "A worker labels objects in an image on a computer screen.",
  "training.imageLabelingCaption": "Careful labels help image models connect visual details with words.",
  "training.noiseTitle": "The Blank Slate: From Static to Sharp Images",
  "training.noiseIntro": "Before an AI can draw anything, it starts as a chaotic mess of digital noise—like a television screen tuned to a dead channel.",
  "training.dataLabel": "The Training Data:",
  "training.dataText": "Engineers feed the AI billions of images paired with text descriptions (like “a red apple on a wooden table”).",
  "training.reverseLabel": "The Reverse Process:",
  "training.reverseText": "The AI learns by practicing how to clean up the noise bit by bit until a clear picture emerges that matches the description. By doing this billions of times, it learns the patterns of light, shadow, texture, and shapes.",
  "training.feedbackTitle": "Teaching Good Taste: Reinforcement Learning",
  "training.feedbackIntro": "Knowing how to draw shapes isn't enough; the AI needs to know what humans actually want to look at. This is where training with human feedback comes in.",
  "training.experimentLabel": "The Experiment:",
  "training.experimentText": "The AI generates multiple versions of a requested image.",
  "training.scoreLabel": "The Score:",
  "training.scoreText": "Human judges look at the results and vote on which one looks best, most realistic, or most creative.",
  "training.adjustmentLabel": "The Adjustment:",
  "training.adjustmentText": "The AI updates its internal rules to favor the paths that lead to \"good\" human scores and avoid the paths that lead to confusion or weird artifacts.",
  "training.humanFeedbackAlt": "A human reviewer examines labeled images on a computer.",
  "training.humanFeedbackCaption": "Human feedback helps models learn which results are useful and clear.",
  "training.promptsTitle": "Why Your Words Matter to the AI",
  "training.promptsIntro": "Because the AI was trained on human text paired with images, it doesn't \"understand\" the world the way we do. It relies entirely on statistical patterns:",
  "training.promptPointOne": "When you type a prompt, you are activating specific pathways in its neural network that it learned during its training phase.",
  "training.promptPointTwo": "Clearer, more descriptive prompts match the clean patterns it saw during training, helping it pull the right visual elements out of the noise.",
